      "1572685b-d638-4e5f-ad3d-b061e89b0627",
      "<p>This is article 1 exploring the BEJSON positional integrity model. BEJSON uses field-map caching for O(1) lookups, atomic writes via temp-then-rename, and strict schema validation at every layer.</p><p>The MFDB federation layer adds multi-file entity routing on top, allowing databases to scale beyond a single file without sacrificing the flat simplicity that makes BEJSON portable on Android/Termux.</p>",
